Command,Shortcut,Description
layout src,,Standard Source view.
layout asm,,Disassembly view.
layout split,,Source + Disassembly (Best for low-level C).
layout regs,,Adds the Register window to the current layout.
focus <win>,fs <win>,"Switch focus (src, asm, regs, cmd) to scroll with arrows."
tui reg general,,Show standard integer registers.
tui reg float,,Show floating-point registers.
refresh,Ctrl+L,Fixes the screen if the layout gets garbled.
tui disable,Ctrl+X A,Toggle back to classic CLI mode.








